    (127, 27, "Trieu Tien Episode 27: Sky Fortune Saint Confrontation",
     "The Sky Fortune Saint had been watching from the Jia Academy stands — his rival's heir battling his own disciple. He had waited three thousand years for this moment. Now he descended to end the Flame Emperor's line.",
     "Saint descends → Reveals identity → Threatens Xiao Yan → Guardian intervenes → Saint amused",
     "Tension → Shock → Threat → Protection → Ominous calm",
     [
         (0,  "Wide — the Jia Academy arena ERUPTS. A figure DESCENDS from the sky — the SKY FORTUNE SAINT: the ancient enemy of the Flame Emperor, still alive after three thousand years, radiating Dou Zun power that makes the entire arena choke. Students collapse to their knees. Camera: wide, Sky Fortune Saint descending, Dou Zun power radiating, students collapsing, arena erupting, 'ancient enemy arrives' moment. 6 seconds.",
          "Wide — Sky Fortune Saint descending, Dou Zun power radiating, students collapsing, ancient enemy arrives, 6s",
          "The Sky Fortune Saint. The Flame Emperor's ancient enemy — the man who had orchestrated the betrayal three thousand years ago. Still alive. Still powerful. And now standing in the same arena as the Flame Emperor's heir.",
          "Saint descending, Dou Zun pressure, students collapsing, ominous music, ancient enemy arrives"),
         (6,  "Close-up — the Sky Fortune Saint speaks. His voice is ancient ice. 'Xiao Yan. The Flame Emperor's signet. I wondered when it would surface.' His eyes are cold, calculating. 'I watched your teacher train you. I let him. Because the son of the Flame Emperor was always going to come back — and I was always going to finish what I started.' Camera: close-up, Sky Fortune Saint's cold eyes, ancient voice, 'Flame Emperor's son' reveal, 'finish what I started' threat, 6 seconds.",
          "Close-up — Sky Fortune Saint's cold eyes, 'Flame Emperor's son' reveal, 'finish what I started' threat, 6s",
          "Three thousand years. The Sky Fortune Saint had been waiting three thousand years — not for the Flame Emperor, but for the Flame Emperor's heir. The one person who carried the signet. The one person who could complete the legacy.",
          "Saint speaking, ice voice, ancient threat, three thousand year wait, ominous strings"),
         (12, "Close-up — Xiao Yan's face. The Sky Fortune Saint — the architect of the Flame Emperor's fall. The man who had killed his wife. Who had orchestrated the betrayal. And he had been watching Xiao Yan grow up. Camera: close-up, Xiao Yan's face registering horror, rage, and cold fury simultaneously, 'architect of betrayal' realization, 'watching me grow up' violation. 6 seconds.",
          "Close-up — Xiao Yan's horror and rage face, realization, 'watching me grow up' violation, 6s",
          "He had been watched. Every training session, every breakthrough, every moment of growth — the Sky Fortune Saint had been there, in the shadows, waiting for the Flame Emperor's signet to ignite. Xiao Yan had been a target since birth.",
          "Horror realization, cold rage, watched since birth, violation music, fury strings"),
         (18, "Wide — the FLAME SECT GUARDIAN steps between them. Dou Zun vs Dou Zun. Ancient flame vs ancient sky fortune power. 'You will not touch the young master,' the guardian says. The Saint smiles — genuinely amused. Camera: wide, guardian stepping between them, Dou Zun vs Dou Zun standoff, guardian's protective stance, Saint's amused smile, 'you will not touch him' declaration. 6 seconds.",
          "Wide — guardian stepping between, Dou Zun vs Dou Zun standoff, protective stance, Saint's amused smile, 6s",
          "The guardian had waited three thousand years for this fight. The Sky Fortune Saint — the one who had ordered his master's destruction. And now he stood between the Saint and his young master, ready to finally settle the debt.",
          "Guardian stepping forward, Dou Zun vs Dou Zun, protective declaration, Saint amused, epic standoff"),
         (24, "Close-up — the Sky Fortune Saint laughs. 'Three thousand years and you send ONE guardian?' He raises one hand — a SKYFORTUNE SEAL appears, ancient and terrible. 'I defeated the Flame Emperor at the height of his power. What is one guardian to me?' Camera: close-up, Saint's amused smile, Sky Fortune Seal appearing, 'defeated Flame Emperor' boast, ominous calm confidence, 'one guardian' dismissal. 6 seconds.",
          "Close-up — Saint's amused smile, Sky Fortune Seal appearing, 'defeated Flame Emperor' boast, ominous calm, 6s",
          "The Sky Fortune Saint had killed the Flame Emperor at his most powerful. He had survived three thousand years. He had orchestrated the betrayal that ended the greatest dynasty in Chinese history. And he was not afraid of one guardian.",
          "Saint laughing, Sky Fortune Seal appearing, boast music, ominous confidence, epic calm")
     ],
     "xianxia, trie u tien, sky fortune saint, xiao yan, flame emperor, guardian, confrontation, ancient enemy, chinese fantasy",
     "Epic Chinese battle orchestral, flame emperor theme, Jia Academy atmosphere, dou qi combat, 95-100 BPM",
     "Trieu Tien Tập 27: Thất Tài Lương Thánh Đối Đầu | Xianxia Việt Sub ⚔️🔥",
     "Episode 27 of Trieu Tien. The Sky Fortune Saint — the ancient enemy who killed the Flame Emperor three thousand years ago — descends on the Jia Academy arena. He reveals he has been watching Xiao Yan since childhood, and the Flame Sect guardian must intervene.\n\n🐉 Trieu Tien — Original Chinese Fantasy Series\n📌 Follow for Episode 28\n#xianxia #trieu tien #sky fortune saint #flame emperor #confrontation",
     "Thất Tài Lương Thánh — kẻ thù ngàn năm của Hoàng Đế — xuất hiện ở Jia Academy. Hắn đã theo dõi Xiao Yan từ khi còn nhỏ. Vệ thần bước ra chắn giữa. Hắn cười: 'Ta đã giết Hoàng Đế, giờ là轮到 ngươi.' ⚔️🔥 Tập 27 Trieu Tien #xianxia #cổtrang"),

    (128, 28, "Trieu Tien Episode 28: Ninefold Burning Heaven Third Transformation",
     "The guardian and the Saint were locked in combat — but the Saint was winning. Xiao Yan had one option: the Ninefold Burning Heaven technique's third transformation, which he had never attempted. Failure meant death.",
     "Guardian overpowered → Xiao Yan intervenes → Third transformation attempted → Fire evolves → Saint surprised",
     "Desperation → Determination → Agony → Power surge → Surprise",
     [
         (0,  "Wide cinematic — the Flame Sect Guardian is being DRIVEN BACK. The Sky Fortune Saint's Sky Fortune Seal — three thousand years of accumulated power — is overwhelming the guardian. Fire vs Sky Fortune. Ancient vs Ancient. Camera: wide, guardian driven back, Sky Fortune Seal overwhelming, fire flickering, guardian losing ground, 'guardian overpowered' moment. 6 seconds.",
          "Wide — guardian driven back, Sky Fortune Seal overwhelming, fire flickering, guardian losing ground, 6s",
          "The guardian was Dou Zun — the highest rank. But the Sky Fortune Saint had been Dou Zun for three thousand years. Accumulated power that no living Dou Zun could match. And he was pushing the guardian back, step by step.",
          "Guardian driven back, Sky Fortune pressure, fire flickering, epic battle roar, desperation strings"),
         (6,  "Close-up — Xiao Yan FLINGS himself between them. Nine-star Dou Huang — against a three-thousand-year-old Dou Zun. His teacher Xiao Yuan shouts from the stands: 'XIAO YAN, NO!' Camera: close-up, Xiao Yan flinging himself between them, nine-star Dou Huang facing ancient Dou Zun, teacher's desperate shout, 'intervenes' moment. 6 seconds.",
          "Close-up — Xiao Yan flinging himself between, nine-star facing ancient Dou Zun, teacher shouting 'no', 6s",
          "Xiao Yan was not Dou Zun. He was not even close. But the guardian had given three thousand years of loyalty, and Xiao Yan would not watch him die alone. He would rather die beside him.",
          "Xiao Yan intervening, teacher's desperate shout, nine-star vs ancient Dou Zun, determination music"),
         (12, "Close-up — Xiao Yan channels the NINEFOLD BURNING HEAVEN technique. His nine-star fire ignites — but transforms. It evolves into a THIRD TRANSFORMATION: the Flame Emperor's ultimate technique, unknown in the living world. His body shakes with strain. Camera: close-up, nine-star fire transforming and evolving, third transformation beginning, body shaking with strain, 'technique evolving' moment. 6 seconds.",
          "Close-up — nine-star fire transforming and evolving, third transformation beginning, body shaking, 6s",
          "The Ninefold Burning Heaven technique was already legendary — Xiao Yan had pushed it further than anyone. But the third transformation was beyond anything he had attempted. His meridians screamed. His fire screamed. And the Saint — stopped.",
          "Technique transforming, meridians straining, third transformation beginning, fire evolving, agony strings"),
         (18, "Wide cinematic — the third transformation BLAZES to life. Xiao Yan's fire turns from orange-gold to WHITE-HOT — the temperature of a sun's core compressed into human form. The Sky Fortune Saint's seal FISSURES on contact. Camera: wide, white-hot fire blazing, Sky Fortune Saint's seal fissuring, Xiao Yan wreathed in white fire, 'Saint surprised' moment. 6 seconds.",
          "Wide — white-hot fire blazing, Sky Fortune Saint's seal fissuring, Xiao Yan wreathed in white fire, 6s",
          "The Sky Fortune Saint had seen the Flame Emperor's fire at its peak. He knew what it could do. And Xiao Yan's fire — the third transformation — was burning hotter than even the original Flame Emperor had ever achieved.",
          "White-hot fire blazing, seal fissuring, Saint surprised, fire evolution music, power surge"),
         (24, "Close-up — the Sky Fortune Saint's cold smile VANISHES. His eyes — for the first time in three thousand years — show GENUINE SHOCK. 'The third transformation,' he whispers. 'Impossible.' Camera: close-up, Saint's smile vanishing, genuine shock in his ancient eyes, 'third transformation impossible' whispered admission, 'Saint surprised' moment. 6 seconds.",
          "Close-up — Saint's smile vanishing, genuine shock, 'third transformation impossible' whispered, 6s",
          "The Sky Fortune Saint had killed the Flame Emperor. He had survived three thousand years. He had been certain — absolutely certain — that the Flame Emperor's line would never produce an heir capable of threatening him. And now a boy — a boy — was burning with the technique he had feared most.",
          "Shock reveal, smile vanishing, three thousand year certainty broken, shock music, revelation swell")
     ],
     "xianxia, trie u tien, ninefold burning heaven, third transformation, sky fortune saint, xiao yan, flame emperor technique, white-hot fire, chinese fantasy",
     "Epic Chinese battle orchestral, flame emperor theme, Jia Academy atmosphere, dou qi combat, 95-100 BPM",
     "Trieu Tien Tập 28: Cửu Kiếp Thiên Hỏa Tam Biến | Xianxia Việt Sub ⚔️🔥",
     "Episode 28 of Trieu Tien. When the Flame Sect guardian is overpowered, Xiao Yan unleashes the Ninefold Burning Heaven technique's third transformation — white-hot fire that makes the Sky Fortune Saint's ancient seal fissure. For the first time in three thousand years, the Saint is genuinely shocked.\n\n🐉 Trieu Tien — Original Chinese Fantasy Series\n📌 Follow for Episode 29\n#xianxia #trieu tien #ninefold #third transformation #sky fortune saint",
     "Khi Vệ thần bị đánh bại, Xiao Yan bung Cửu Kiếp Thiên Hỏa Tam Biến — lửa trắng nóng phá vỡ ấn của Thất Tài Lương Thánh. Lần đầu tiên trong ba ngàn năm, hắn sợ hãi thực sự. ⚔️🔥 Tập 28 Trieu Tien #xianxia #cổtrang"),

    (129, 29, "Trieu Tien Episode 29: The Flame Emperor's Legacy Claimed",
     "The Saint was shaken — but not defeated. Xiao Yan had one final weapon: the Flame Emperor's own memories, now fully integrated. Three thousand years of battle experience, techniques, and the true origin of fire power — all Xiao Yan's now.",
     "Saint recovers → Xiao Yan calls on memories → True fire origin revealed → Flame Emperor's final technique → Saint retreats",
     "Tension → Integration → Revelation → Power peak → Saint withdraws",
     [
         (0,  "Close-up — the Sky Fortune Saint REGROUPS. His fissured seal repairs itself with dark energy. His ancient eyes refocus. 'Impressive,' he says coldly. 'But you are still nine-star Dou Huang. And I am three thousand years of Dou Zun.' Camera: close-up, Saint's seal repairing, regrouping, cold refocus, 'still nine-star' dismissal, Saint recovering. 6 seconds.",
          "Close-up — Saint's seal repairing, regrouping, cold refocus, 'still nine-star' dismissal, 6s",
          "The Sky Fortune Saint had survived three thousand years by never underestimating an enemy twice. Xiao Yan's third transformation was impressive — but three thousand years of accumulated Dou Zun power was not something a nine-star Dou Huang could match in raw strength.",
          "Saint recovering, seal repairing, cold refocus, three thousand years power, regrouping drums"),
         (6,  "Close-up — Xiao Yan closes his eyes. The Flame Emperor's memories — three thousand years of battle experience — SURGE through him. He is no longer just Xiao Yan. He is Xiao Yan plus three millennia of the greatest Dou Zun who ever lived. Camera: close-up, Xiao Yan closing eyes, memories surging, expression shifting between his own and the Flame Emperor's, 'integration' moment. 6 seconds.",
          "Close-up — closing eyes, memories surging, expression shifting between Xiao Yan and Flame Emperor, 6s",
          "The Flame Emperor had been the greatest Dou Zun in history. Three thousand years of techniques, battle wisdom, and the ultimate fire origin — all sealed in Xiao Yan's signet. And now, with the third transformation as a conduit, he could finally access all of it.",
          "Memories surging, Flame Emperor wisdom flooding in, integration music, ancient knowledge"),
         (12, "Wide cinematic — the TRUE ORIGIN OF FIRE manifests: not mere flame, but the PRIMAL FIRE ELEMENT — the fire that existed before the world, the fire that burned in the first star. Xiao Yan's body becomes a conduit for the fire of creation itself. Camera: wide, Primal Fire Element manifesting, fire of first star, Xiao Yan as conduit for creation fire, 'true fire origin' revelation. 6 seconds.",
          "Wide — Primal Fire Element manifesting, fire of first star, Xiao Yan as conduit, creation fire, 6s",
          "The Flame Emperor had not just commanded fire. He had become fire. The Primal Fire Element — the fire that existed before the world had a name. And Xiao Yan, through the memories, through the signet, through the third transformation — had now inherited that origin.",
          "Primal fire manifesting, fire of creation, first star, revelation music, cosmic fire"),
         (18, "Close-up — Xiao Yan's eyes open. They are no longer flame — they are GALAXIES of fire. Stars burning in his irises. The Flame Emperor's final technique: UNIVERSE FIRE COLLAPSE. He raises one hand and the Sky Fortune Saint's seal SHATTERS. Camera: close-up, galaxies in eyes, Universe Fire Collapse raised hand, seal shattering, 'final technique' moment. 6 seconds.",
          "Close-up — galaxies in eyes, Universe Fire Collapse, seal shattering, final technique, 6s",
          "Universe Fire Collapse. The technique that had ended the original battle three thousand years ago — the Flame Emperor's last resort. He had used it then and died. But Xiao Yan was not the Flame Emperor. Xiao Yan had the nine-star breakthrough. And he would not die here.",
          "Universe Fire Collapse, galaxies in eyes, seal shattering, final technique, epic orchestral crescendo"),
         (24, "Wide — the Sky Fortune Saint STAGGERS. His ancient seal — three thousand years of accumulated power — SHATTERS. He looks at Xiao Yan with something he has not felt in millennia: FEAR. 'This is not over,' he says, and vanishes into the sky. Camera: wide, Saint staggering, seal shattered, ancient fear in his eyes, 'this is not over' retreat declaration, Saint vanishing. 6 seconds.",
          "Wide — Saint staggering, seal shattered, fear in ancient eyes, 'this is not over' retreat, vanishing into sky, 6s",
          "The Sky Fortune Saint — the most powerful being in the Chinese continent, survivor of three thousand years — had just retreated from a twenty-year-old Dou Huang. Not because he had to. But because he was afraid. And that changed everything.",
          "Saint retreating, seal shattered, three thousand year fear, 'not over' declaration, triumphant orchestral swell")
     ],
     "xianxia, trie u tien, flame emperor legacy, true fire origin, universe fire collapse, sky fortune saint retreat, xiao yan, chinese fantasy",
     "Epic Chinese battle orchestral, flame emperor theme, Jia Academy atmosphere, dou qi combat, 95-100 BPM",
     "Trieu Tien Tập 29: Di Sản Hoàng Đế Lửa | Xianxia Việt Sub ⚔️🔥",
     "Episode 29 of Trieu Tien. Xiao Yan fully integrates the Flame Emperor's three thousand years of memories and accesses the Primal Fire Element — the true origin of fire power. He unleashes Universe Fire Collapse and shatters the Sky Fortune Saint's ancient seal. The Saint retreats in fear for the first time in millennia.\n\n🐉 Trieu Tien — Original Chinese Fantasy Series\n📌 Follow for Episode 30\n#xianxia #trieu tien #flame emperor #universe fire #primal fire",
     "Xiao Yan hấp thụ toàn bộ ký ức Hoàng Đế — lửa nguyên thủy, kỹ thuật Vũ Trụ Hỏa Sụp Đổ. Ấn của Thất Tài Lương Thánh tan vỡ. Hắn rút lui trong sợ hãi lần đầu tiên sau ngàn năm. ⚔️🔥 Tập 29 Trieu Tien #xianxia #cổtrang"),

    (130, 30, "Trieu Tien Episode 30: Dou Zun Achieved — The Flame Emperor's Heir",
     "The Sky Fortune Saint had retreated, but his words echoed: 'This is not over.' Xiao Yan had days, perhaps hours. He needed to break through to Dou Zun now — or the Saint would return with an army. The Flame Emperor's final gift would make it possible.",
     "Saint's words echo → Breakthrough demanded → Flame Emperor's final gift → Dou Zun achieved → New era begins",
     "Urgency → Struggle → Divine intervention → Transcendence → Closure and beginning",
     [
         (0,  "Wide — Xiao Yan stands alone on the Jia Academy battlefield. The arena is destroyed. The Sky Fortune Saint's fading words echo: 'This is not over.' Xiao Yan's face: determined but exhausted. Nine-star Dou Huang — against a three-thousand-year-old enemy. Camera: wide, destroyed arena, Xiao Yan alone, Saint's echo words, exhausted determination, 'urgency' moment. 6 seconds.",
          "Wide — destroyed arena, Xiao Yan alone, Saint's echo words, exhausted determination, urgency, 6s",
          "The Saint had retreated. But he would return — with an army, with alliances, with everything he had. Xiao Yan had days, maybe hours, before the full weight of the Sky Fortune Saint's power came crashing down on the Chinese continent.",
          "Arena destroyed, Saint's echo, urgency music, tension drums, determination strings"),
         (6,  "Close-up — Xiao Yan looks at the Flame Ember Signet. It pulses — a final light, the Flame Emperor's last gift. A COMPLETE DOU ZUN BREAKTHROUGH — every meridian, every star, every fire element aligned at once. 'Now,' he whispers. Camera: close-up, Flame Ember Signet pulsing with final light, 'now' whispered breakthrough, Flame Emperor's last gift, 'breakthrough demanded' moment. 6 seconds.",
          "Close-up — signet pulsing, 'now' whispered breakthrough, Flame Emperor's last gift, breakthrough demanded, 6s",
          "The Flame Emperor had saved one last gift — a complete Dou Zun breakthrough, compressed into the signet. Every meridian unlocked. Every fire element aligned. The Flame Emperor's final act of love for the heir who would finish what he started.",
          "Signet pulsing final light, 'now' whispered, breakthrough demanded, flame gift, urgency music"),
         (12, "Wide cinematic — Xiao Yan's body IGNITES. The nine-star fire merges with the Flame Emperor's Primal Fire Element. Every meridian in his body — blocked since birth by the poison of betrayal — SHATTERS OPEN. Camera: wide, nine-star fire merging with Primal Fire Element, meridians shattering open, full breakthrough beginning, 'meridians opening' moment. 6 seconds.",
          "Wide — nine-star fire merging, meridians shattering open, full breakthrough beginning, meridians opening, 6s",
          "Dou Zun was not just a rank. It was a fundamental transformation of the body's relationship with dou qi. And for Xiao Yan — with every meridian blocked since birth by the poison of his enemies — it was not just a breakthrough. It was liberation.",
          "Meridians shattering, fire merging, breakthrough beginning, liberation music, full power"),
         (18, "Extreme wide cinematic — a PILLAR OF WHITE-GOLD FIRE erupts from Xiao Yan's body and pierces the sky. The Jia Academy — the entire Chinese continent — feels it. Dou Huangs across the land look up in awe. Camera: extreme wide, white-gold fire pillar piercing sky, entire continent feeling breakthrough, Dou Huangs looking up, 'Dou Zun achieved' moment. 6 seconds.",
          "Extreme wide — white-gold fire pillar piercing sky, continent feeling breakthrough, Dou Huangs looking up, 6s",
          "A Dou Zun breakthrough was felt across the entire Chinese continent. Every dou qi practitioner felt the surge — and knew that somewhere, someone had just crossed the most important threshold in martial arts history.",
          "Fire pillar piercing sky, continent feeling, Dou Huangs looking up, awe music, continental swell"),
         (24, "Wide cinematic — Xiao Yan RISES from the ground. Dou Zun aura surrounds him — a ring of nine-colored flame and white-gold Primal Fire. His eyes are galaxies. The Flame Sect guardian kneels. His teacher Xiao Yuan kneels. The entire Jia Academy arena kneels. Camera: wide, Xiao Yan rising in full Dou Zun aura, guardian and teacher and entire academy kneeling, 'Dou Zun achieved' finale moment. 6 seconds.",
          "Wide — Xiao Yan rising in full Dou Zun aura, guardian and teacher and academy kneeling, Dou Zun achieved, 6s",
          "Dou Zun. The Flame Emperor had reached it at sixty. Xiao Yan's teacher Xiao Yuan was aiming for it at fifty. Xiao Yan had reached it at nineteen — the youngest Dou Zun in the recorded history of the Chinese continent. The Flame Emperor's heir was no longer an heir. He was the Flame Emperor.",
          "Rising in Dou Zun aura, academy kneeling, youngest Dou Zun, Flame Emperor's heir becomes Emperor, triumphant crescendo")
     ],
     "xianxia, trie u tien, dou zun achieved, flame emperor heir, xiao yan, sky fortune saint, breakthrough, series finale, chinese fantasy",
     "Epic Chinese battle orchestral, flame emperor theme, Jia Academy atmosphere, dou qi combat, 95-100 BPM",
     "Trieu Tien Tập 30 (Cuối Mùa): Đấu Tôn Trở Thành | Xianxia Việt Sub ⚔️🔥",
     "SERIES FINALE of Trieu Tien. With the Sky Fortune Saint's threat looming, Xiao Yan uses the Flame Emperor's final gift to achieve the impossible — Dou Zun breakthrough at nineteen, becoming the youngest Dou Zun in Chinese history. The entire Jia Academy kneels before the Flame Emperor's heir who has become the Flame Emperor.\n\n🐉 Trieu Tien — Original Chinese Fantasy Series\n🏆 Thank you for watching!\n#xianxia #trieu tien #dou zun #series finale #flame emperor #xiao yan #transcendent",
     "Mùa 1 KẾT THÚC: Xiao Yan sử dụng di sản cuối cùng của Hoàng Đế để đột phá Đấu Tôn ở tuổi 19 — trẻ nhất lịch sử Trung Quốc. Toàn bộ Jia Academy quỳ xuống trước người thừa kế đã trở thành Hoàng Đế. Mùa 1 KẾT THÚC ⚔️🔥 Trieu Tien #xianxia #cổtrang #seriefinale"),
